cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MEIDNet Matter, please cite the MEIDNet paper and the software."
title: "MEIDNet Matter: crystal structures for a requested band gap, each with the evidence for it"
abstract: "A multimodal inverse-design workbench for crystalline materials. Ask for a band gap and get crystal structures back, each with two machine-learning readings of the PBE gap, its checks and its limits; the Design Readiness report says what the data and the model support, and the same staged pipeline runs on your own data locally. MEIDNet is the scientific engine."
